stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending --> TargetsAvailable: every target name and UID resolves
    Pending --> Failed: target mapping is invalid
    TargetsAvailable --> Restoring: identity map is valid and leaves activated
    Restoring --> Ready: every target reports Restored True
    Restoring --> Failed: any target reports terminal failure
    Ready --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]

    note right of Ready
        Kubernetes Pod readiness and serving
        readiness remain external to Snapshot.
    end note
